It's been a couple of years since I played a Valkyrie, but I think you
are ready to do the quest.  The Valkyrie quest is probably the easiest
one.  Lord Surtur is a wuss.  Just be wary of slipping on the ice.  And
if your stuff isn't fireproof, do a lot of searching to avoid fire
traps.

Alternatively, you could do Medusa/Castle/VotD now, but I don't see any
real reason to put off the quest.  I'll be interested to see if anyone
recommends deferring it for later, and why.

